{"id":"nf0a4062a2b","headline":"Sensex Surges 790 Points, Nifty Reclaims 24,000 As IT And Banking Stocks Rally","summary":"Indian benchmarks ended sharply higher on Wednesday, led by IT, banking and realty stocks. The Sensex rose 790 points and the Nifty closed above 24,000, despite weakness in auto and metal shares.","why":"The Sensex and Nifty are the main benchmark indices of India's equity market, tracking the country's largest listed companies.","category":"markets","event_type":"other","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":true,"location":{"place":"Mumbai","country":"India","lat":19.08,"lon":72.88,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Free Press Journal","url":"https://www.freepressjournal.in/business/sensex-surges-790-points-nifty-reclaims-24000-as-it-and-banking-stocks-rally"},"sources":[{"name":"Free Press Journal","url":"https://www.freepressjournal.in/business/sensex-surges-790-points-nifty-reclaims-24000-as-it-and-banking-stocks-rally"}],"published_at":"2026-06-24T10:41:13Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T13:38:59Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"dac8e38dc42a0b3c","impacts":[],"why_moved":"Strong buying in IT, banking and realty stocks lifted the index, with positive sentiment supporting broad gains despite weakness in autos and metals.","backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T13:38:59Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-06-24T10:41:13Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-06-24T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IN","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/stock-market-trading-screen-6955781.jpg","alt":"stock market trading screen (illustration)","credit":"OleksandrPidvalnyi","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/stock-business